  "details": "On Starbound players can form a band and when players play song they play it in sync. Those songs are synced on client side so network delay dosen't effect to them.\n\nSo, idea is same kind but on VRChat, players can make avatars that has animation which matches with other avatars animations. When group of players has those avatars, they can form a \"idol group\" XD and when group is formed, evey emotion which is played by group leader will play on every group member at same time and on client side synced.\n\nAnd same idea to worlds too. To seats animation group. When its triggered, all avatars which uses seat on same seat group will start playing animation... on client side synced.",
